%% Main system flow - Gemini Music Recommender
%% Preview: https://mermaid.live or a Mermaid extension in VS Code.
%% Must match the code. If a module changes, update this file.
%% Yellow = a human is involved. Gemini only writes and reads language; code does all scoring and number updates.
flowchart TD
    A(["User<br/>console (main.py) or web (app.py)<br/>run_eval.py plays a fake user when testing"]):::human
    B["1. Input check<br/>guardrails.py<br/>blocks injection, personal data, self-harm, long text"]
    C["2. Interview agent<br/>interview.py<br/>asks, answers questions, extracts preferences"]
    DOCS[("Knowledge docs<br/>docs/*.md")]
    D["Retriever (RAG)<br/>retriever.py<br/>finds the most relevant doc text"]
    E{{"Gemini<br/>llm.py"}}
    V["Validate Gemini's output<br/>preferences.py<br/>only known fields and real catalog labels"]
    F["3. User profile"]
    G[("Song catalog<br/>songs.csv")]
    H["4. Recommender<br/>recommender.py<br/>scores every song, shows top 5 with reasons"]
    J([5. User rates each song 1-10<br/>and may add a comment]):::human
    K["6. Feedback<br/>feedback.py<br/>metrics, then profile update<br/>(run_eval.py checks the result: PASS or FAIL)"]

    A --> B --> C
    DOCS --> D
    D -->|retrieved text| C
    C <-->|questions, answers, extraction| E
    E --> V
    V --> F
    F --> H
    G --> H
    H --> J
    J --> K
    K -->|"new profile + unseen songs<br/>(Regenerate after all 5 rated)"| H
    K -.->|"comments only"| E

    classDef human fill:#ffe9a8,stroke:#b58900,color:#000
